Permissible phase values, in degrees, associated with restricted Fourier amplitudes obtained via Fourier transform of a three-dimensional crystal lattice.

The 16 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `1`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

namespace A383116

